  -> anywhere

? answer_garden@11111111111111111111
  I would like to see the garden.
  -> garden

:: anywhere
> cat_anywhere_001@a11b4b64dceda892c08e speaker=cheshire_cat
  Then it doesn't matter which way you go.
-> END

:: garden
